{"id":"ebe5483ba604bc90","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-binary-np.md","title":"Complexity Class NP","display":"df-complexity-class-np — Complexity Class NP","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-binary-np","aliases":["73-df-binary-np","73-df-complexity-class-np"],"display":"df-complexity-class-np — Complexity Class NP","depends_on":["[[73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.1, print pp. 425–434; PDF pp. 447–456; local polynomial-time interface","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§13.1–13.3 and §13.7, pp. 320–343, 362–364; local machine/certificate/coding interfaces","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-binary-np"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-binary-np</span><span>73-df-complexity-class-np</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-complexity-class-np — Complexity Class NP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83a4535946978ce2\" href=\"?note=83a4535946978ce2\" title=\"73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds\">73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.1, print pp. 425–434; PDF pp. 447–456; local polynomial-time interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§13.1–13.3 and §13.7, pp. 320–343, 362–364; local machine/certificate/coding interfaces"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NTIME}\">\\(\\mathsf{NTIME}\\)</span> (nondeterministic time classes, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83a4535946978ce2\" href=\"?note=83a4535946978ce2\" title=\"73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds\">73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}class\\text{-}np}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NP}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}\\mathsf{NTIME}(n\\mapsto(n+1)^k)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}class\\text{-}np}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NP}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}\\mathsf{NTIME}(n\\mapsto(n+1)^k)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The polynomial-verifier characterization is equivalent theorem content and is not used circularly to define <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NP}\">\\(\\mathsf{NP}\\)</span> here.</li>\n<li>The shift by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> respects the positive codomain required of time bounds at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> and leaves polynomial time unchanged.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds","status":"resolved","id":"83a4535946978ce2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds","status":"resolved","id":"83a4535946978ce2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{NTIME}$ (nondeterministic time classes, see [[73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{NTIME}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}class\\text{-}np}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NP}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}}\\mathsf{NTIME}(n\\mapsto(n+1)^k)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false}],"bytes":1517,"backlinks":[{"id":"1fa0c4e009de5637","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{NP}$ (nondeterministic polynomial-time class, see [[73-df-binary-np]])"},{"id":"41d5b79d11297576","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{NP}$ (NP language class, see [[73-df-binary-np]])"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-244","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-np|Complexity Class NP]]"},{"id":"f083376270d496d8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b744279d55b870f3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"25929fba481aa4a1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9a591370db4d4b2b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depend